      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2290,
      "text": "It is We Who will inherit the earth and all those who are on it, and to Us they will be returned.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 265,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2291,
      "text": "And mention in the Book [the story of] Abraham. He was indeed a man of truth and a prophet.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2292,
      "text": "When he said to his father, “O my dear father, why do you worship something that neither hears nor sees nor benefits you in any way?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2293,
      "text": "O my dear father, there has come to me some knowledge that has not come to you, so follow me; I will guide you to a straight path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2294,
      "text": "O my dear father, do not worship Satan. Indeed, Satan is rebellious against the Most Compassionate.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2295,
      "text": "O my dear father, I truly fear that a punishment from the Most Compassionate may afflict you and that you may become a companion of Satan [in Hell].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2296,
      "text": "He said, “Are you turning away from my gods, O Abraham? If you do not desist, I will surely stone you. Keep away from me for a long time!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2297,
      "text": "Abraham said, “Peace be on you[11]. I will seek my Lord’s forgiveness for you. Indeed, He is Most Gracious to me.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2298,
      "text": "I will distance myself from you and from all that you supplicate besides Allah, and I will supplicate my Lord; perhaps my supplication to my Lord will not go unanswered.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2299,
      "text": "When he distanced himself from them and what they worshiped besides Allah, We granted him Isaac and Jacob and made each one of them a prophet.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 308,
      "ruku": 266,
      "hizbQuarter": 123,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2300,
      "text": "We bestowed upon them of Our mercy and blessed them with a highly-esteemed reputation[12].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
